LABEL="Release 135: PL-1 plot point notes. A plot point label that only restates its point (its x or y, alone or as (x, y)) gets no badge or list line, and a plot keeps at most 6 point notes; every data mark stays. Web renderer only; the two shipped figures that printed their own y values (regression step fit, threshold search, detailed depth) lose those notes. No migrations, no config change. Stacked on release 134."
